[2250.372, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 6/8 · Judge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The judge is an acceptance test script I build now: it runs on both the first version and the final, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  every promise in the original ask and the restatement maps to a measurable check. The visual bar gets a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  12-frame contact sheet at desktop and phone size, which I'll look at once.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
